<title>USA: Zeneca gets U.S. exclusivity on Diprivan.</title>
<headline>Zeneca gets U.S. exclusivity on Diprivan.</headline>
<dateline>WILMINGTON, Del. 1997-03-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Zeneca Inc said Thursday the U.S. Food and Drug Administration had given it exclusivity for the modified formulation of Diprivan, an intravenous sedative, until June 11, 1999.</p>
<p>Diprivan is used to induce and maintain anesthesia and ICU sedation.</p>
<p>Zeneca Inc is a subsidiary of Zeneca Group Plc of Britain.</p>
</text>
